      "text": "160多张卡与萨满图腾组成多路线协同牌组",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Craft over 160 cards and fashion synergistic decks that focus on poison, strength, sacrifice, retaliation, backstabbing, blocking, movement , and more. Discover shamanic totems with unique effects to enhance your deck.",
