      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每一步都关键的网格战斗叠加环境利弊",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Face a host of restless spirits - Skulldogs, Crackle Bursts, Woeful Seashrooms and more - in grid-based battles where each move is crucial . Test your wit by fighting unique enemy types, powerful bosses, and mini-bosses, all while taking into account environmental hazards and boons.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2825880/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "悲恸猎人穿越灵界寻回亡子",
      "dimension": "故事",
